# timezone 'America/New_York' (Eastern band) without the IP/TZ
# mismatch being detectable. Bands: UTC, North_America_East,
# North_America_Central, North_America_Mountain, North_America_Pacific,
# Europe_West, Europe_East, Asia_East, Asia_South, Asia_Southeast,
